- You're like,

00:08:36.903 --> 00:08:38.710
you're playing yourself

00:08:38.710 --> 00:08:40.530
like you're the hype guy and
you're writing the lyrics.

00:08:40.530 --> 00:08:42.799
- He's like, "I'm not doing anything."

00:08:42.799 --> 00:08:44.160
I was like, "You're a song writer.

00:08:44.160 --> 00:08:45.325
"You're just naturally good at it.

00:08:45.325 --> 00:08:46.467
"It's easy for you."

00:08:46.467 --> 00:08:47.587
- [Kelly] Oh, how fun is that

00:08:47.587 --> 00:08:48.707
to be with your family?
- It's so nice.

00:08:48.707 --> 00:08:49.704
It's so good.

00:08:49.704 --> 00:08:50.800
I'm trying to get him a plug deal.

00:08:50.800 --> 00:08:51.633
Anyone looking out, he's a song writer,

00:08:51.633 --> 00:08:53.266
and he also was conducting my vocals.

00:08:53.266 --> 00:08:54.990
- That's good.

00:08:54.990 --> 00:08:55.840
This is the secret.

00:08:55.840 --> 00:08:57.325
My sister's like that.

00:08:57.325 --> 00:08:58.990
When I have a studio, she
was like, it was, yeah.

00:08:58.990 --> 00:09:00.597
And then she'll be like, "This is amazing.

00:09:00.597 --> 00:09:01.430
"Don't screw it up.

00:09:01.430 --> 00:09:02.600
"Don't let them over produce it."

00:09:02.600 --> 00:09:04.950
- Okay, yeah, family.

00:09:04.950 --> 00:09:06.540
- Well, so Meghan and Ryan.

00:09:06.540 --> 00:09:09.650
So you were always best
friends as a family.

00:09:09.650 --> 00:09:11.820
And I think that we have
the video to prove it.

00:09:11.820 --> 00:09:12.653
Let's see.

00:09:13.645 --> 00:09:15.427
- [Dad] Didn't I say don't bug him?

00:09:15.427 --> 00:09:16.927
- I won't bug him!

00:09:18.422 --> 00:09:21.672
- Well you just ran into him didn't ya?

00:09:22.522 --> 00:09:24.284
- Don't talk to me.

00:09:24.284 --> 00:09:27.987
I'm gonna be his best friend
and not your best friend.

00:09:27.987 --> 00:09:29.237
- I like daddy.

00:09:30.226 --> 00:09:31.528
I'm his best friend.

00:09:31.528 --> 00:09:33.778
- I'm your best friend too!

00:09:35.090 --> 00:09:35.923
I'm sassy.

00:09:36.910 --> 00:09:40.280
- That's literally you
guys, when you were kids.

00:09:40.280 --> 00:09:42.620
- Yeah, I really wanted to be best friends

00:09:42.620 --> 00:09:44.053
with my brother and my dad.

00:09:44.945 --> 00:09:45.778
And it was like always a competition.

00:09:45.778 --> 00:09:46.900
Who's best friends?

00:09:46.900 --> 00:09:50.640
- Y'all need you to write
a Christmas Hallmark movie

00:09:50.640 --> 00:09:53.610
with Christmas songs and do
the whole thing together.

00:09:53.610 --> 00:09:54.960
as a family.
- I'm down.

00:09:54.960 --> 00:09:56.900
- I would watch and listen to this.

00:09:56.900 --> 00:09:58.180
That was adorable.

00:09:58.180 --> 00:09:59.760
All right, well it's time for a break.

00:09:59.760 --> 00:10:02.460
Everyone go get the new album,
A Very Trainor Christmas.

00:10:02.460 --> 00:10:03.850
It comes out October 30th.

00:10:03.850 --> 00:10:05.187
Congratulations, it's a boy!

00:10:05.187 --> 00:10:06.020
- It's a boy!

